1
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:03,180
(Howard:)Hey, put your tie
back in your pants.

2
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:06,450
(Raj:)Nice place.

3
00:00:06,450 --> 00:00:09,060
(Raj:)Reminds me of my parents'
house back in New Delhi.

4
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:11,230
- You're kidding.
- No. We are very wealthy.

5
00:00:11,230 --> 00:00:14,330
(Raj:)But the only difference is,
we have more servants.

6
00:00:14,330 --> 00:00:16,110
- More than this?
- More than we can use.

7
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:17,570
(Raj:)You see, in India,
we don't make the mistake

8
00:00:17,610 --> 00:00:20,080
of letting up poor people
have dreams.

9
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:24,440
(Seibert:)Ah. There's my band
of brainiacs.

10
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:25,540
(Seibert:)Where's Dr. Cooper?

11
00:00:26,710 --> 00:00:31,010
(Leonard:)He's tearing the mask off nature
to look at the face of God.

12
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,680
(Seibert:)The board of directors insists
he has a beautiful mind.

13
00:00:33,680 --> 00:00:35,010
(Seibert:)I think he's just bananas.

14
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:37,380
(Seibert:)Come on, let me introduce you

15
00:00:37,380 --> 00:00:39,150
(Seibert:)to one of the university's
leading donors.

16
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:44,920
(Raj:)I think we were misled
about the cute girls.

17
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:47,430
(Seibert:)Mrs. Latham, I'd like
you to meet three

18
00:00:47,430 --> 00:00:48,890
(Seibert:)of our outstanding
young researchers.

19
00:00:48,890 --> 00:00:50,460
(Seibert:)This is Dr. Leonard
Hofstadter,

20
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:53,900
(Seibert:)Dr. Rajesh Koothrappali
and Howard Wolowitz.

21
00:00:53,900 --> 00:00:55,400
(Mrs Latham:)Well, what happened
to you, Wolowitz,

22
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:58,270
(Mrs Latham:)couldn't stick with it
long enough to get your PhD?

23
00:00:58,270 --> 00:01:00,100
(Howard:)I'm an engineer.

